;; Sophia's mini game, Underworld, section 1: the tank's cavern (Blaster Master Area 1 style).
;; cavern.ts loads it with ?raw, so it is not in the level library, the dev level select or the
;; campaign. Row 0 stays clear under the HUD; row 1 is the cavern's roof all along, so the tank can't
;; jump and hover over a wall behind the HUD.
;;
;; The route: the cavern floor (a crawler) -> a step up and a wall of bricks under a low roof (the
;; cannon breaks it; a hopper, a crawler) -> ledges with flyers over them -> the open cavern (a
;; hopper, a crawler, a flyer) -> the gateway's shaft: a ladder (vine) up a shaft one tile wide
;; (68-70), too narrow for the tank, to the ledge (rows 5-6, columns 70-79, under a rock ceiling)
;; where the gateway stands (76-77). Only Jason on foot gets there: hop out, climb, walk in.
;; Mutants are the mini game's own entity types (World's extraEntities, cavern.ts).
id: bm-underworld
name: UNDERWORLD
world: 8
stage: 4
theme: underworld
music: bm-area
time: 300
start: 2,12
startMode: stand
camera: scroll

